# Extracted from the committed sars.zip by `sars unpack`; 25 MB of duplicate
# bytes, so it is rebuilt rather than stored.
data/

# NOTE: output/ is intentionally committed so the converted HTML+CSS, the A4
# PDFs and the reference/output comparison images can be reviewed directly on
# GitHub without running the pipeline. Regenerate with `sars all`.
#
# These entries are the exception: intermediate artefacts of the sars_convert
# pipeline that are large, machine-generated and of no review value.
output/ir/
output/VERIFICATION.md
output/verify_report.json

